<title>UK: CSFB sets call warrants on Novartis.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets call warrants on Novartis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston said it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Novartis.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 50 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2,100 CHF		 PREMIUM	12.85 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.75 CHF		  GEARING	10.81 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.JUN.97-21.AUG.98   PAYDATE	06.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  2,027 CHF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
